zyphoros-installer (1.1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Name the live user after the distro.
  * Depend on cracklib-runtime: without its dictionary Calamares rejects
    every password.
  * Depend on dosfstools and squashfs-tools: Calamares can't create the
    EFI partition or copy the system without them.

